  {
    "index": 98,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Get a whiff of that fragrance...\\nHow about some incense for you, [VAR 1100(00FF,0403)]boygirl?"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Come back anytime."
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Would you care for any other varieties?"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "The [VAR 010A(0000)], is it?\\nAnd how many would you like?"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "If you\u2019d like [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 010A(0000)],\\nit\u2019s going to cost you \uE300[VAR 0206(0002,002C)]. All right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "If you\u2019d like [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 010A(0000)],\\nit\u2019s going to cost you \uE300[VAR 0206(0002,002C)]. All right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "And here is your incense.\\nI look forward to serving you again.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I\u2019m sorry, but it looks like you have no space\\nto carry more incense.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "I\u2019m sorry...\\nYou simply don\u2019t have the funds.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You want [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1000][VAR 010A(0000)]?\\nThat\u2019ll be [VAR 0206(0002,002C)] BP, all right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You want [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1001][VAR 010A(0000)]?\\nThat\u2019ll be [VAR 0206(0002,002C)] BP, all right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "Ey up, welcome to the Herb Shop!\\nLet\u2019s see what you buy, shall we?"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cheers, mate!\\nCome by again anytime!"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Need anything else?"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "How many [VAR 1001][VAR 010A(0000)] do you want?"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Right, [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1000][VAR 010A(0000)]!\\nThat\u2019ll be \uE300[VAR 0206(0002,002C)], mate!"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Right, [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1001][VAR 010A(0000)]!\\nThat\u2019ll be \uE300[VAR 0206(0002,002C)], mate!"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "And here you go!\\nThey\u2019ll work a treat\u2014I promise!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Come on, mate! Give us a break.\\nYou can\u2019t carry any more!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Wot? You\u2019re looking a bit light on cash, mate.\\nSave up and come back later!\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You want [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1000][VAR 010A(0000)]?\\nThat\u2019ll be [VAR 0206(0002,002C)] BP, all right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You want [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1001][VAR 010A(0000)]?\\nThat\u2019ll be [VAR 0206(0002,002C)] BP, all right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Berries! I\u2019ve got your fresh-picked Berries!\\nWhat do you say? Interested in something?"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Thanks for stopping by! Come again!"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Would you care for any other kinds of Berries?"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "How many [VAR 1001][VAR 0109(0000)] shall it be?"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "So, just [VAR 0202(0001)] of those [VAR 1001][VAR 0109(0000)]...\\nThat\u2019ll be \uE300[VAR 0206(0002,002C)]."
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "So, [VAR 0202(0001)] of those [VAR 1001][VAR 0109(0000)]...\\nThat\u2019ll put you at \uE300[VAR 0206(0002,002C)]."
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "And here you are!\\nGive one to your Pok\u00E9mon, won\u2019t you?\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Blimey, looks like you can\u2019t carry any more of\\nthose Berries, friend.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Seems you can\u2019t pay the bill!\\nI\u2019m sorry to say it, but I can\u2019t give my goods away.\\c"
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You want [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1000][VAR 010A(0000)]?\\nThat\u2019ll be [VAR 0206(0002,002C)] BP, all right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You want [VAR 0202(0001)] [VAR 1001][VAR 010A(0000)]?\\nThat\u2019ll be [VAR 0206(0002,002C)] BP, all right?"
  },
