  {
    "index": 149,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to our boutique!\\nAnything I can help you find?"
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Thank you for coming by! And do feel free to use\\nour changing room whenever you\u2019d like to."
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the uniform shop!\\nAre you looking for anything in particular?"
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Thanks for coming by!"
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "Ah! My goodness! Beg your pardon, but is that a\\nStyle Card you have there?"
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Those cards are the stuff of legend! Only the\\nfreshest fashion mavens in all Galar carry them!"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "Allow me to show you our finest selections! It\u2019s only\\nfitting for a customer so beloved by high fashion!"
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "For now, kindly accept this ensemble from us\u2014\\non the house!"
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "flags": 4,
    "text": "Anyway, with all that said..."
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission at Turffield Stadium,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission at Hulbury Stadium,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission at Motostoke Stadium,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission at Stow-on-Side Stadium,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission at Ballonlea Stadium,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission at Circhester Stadium,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission in Spikemuth,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Cleared the Gym mission at Hammerlocke Stadium,\\ndid you, young Challenger?"
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Congratulations!\\c\\nNow you can purchase more items.\\nSo..."
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "You\u2019re the greatest Champion, the one who\\nmanaged to defeat the undefeatable Leon!\\c\\nCongratulations on your victory!\\nAnd thank you for visiting our little shop!\\c\\nAnd with that said..."
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome, Champion!\\nHere to do a spot of shopping?"
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Happy birthday to you!\\nWe wish you many happy returns, and hope you\\r\\nwill continue to use the Pok\u00E9 Mart always!"
